One bag of holding is lighter than 2. It has no practical limit to what it
can carry. All a second bag does is add in the weight of the second bag.

Unless you are nesting bags inside each other, and using a half dozen
sacks/oilskins to protect from explosion....that can lower your weight a
lot, but at the cost of being a giant pain in the ass to juggle those extra
bags, and even nesting a BoH inside several normal bags still carries a
risk of exploding both bags when you stash the full one.

>I'm wondering if anyone has any thoughts on this.  I know I'm not being
>very specific.

Once I'm past the mines/sokoban, generally being burdened isn't a huge deal
for me. A lot of vets will probably go all bugshit about that, but tough
noogies. Hell, my last ascension was done burdened all the way from the
vibrating square to the high altar. I was even STRESSED on the astral plane
for a little bit.

However, to reduce weight, you just need to carry less stuff. Set up a
stash and keep excess equipment there. Ignore things that aren't really
useful to you anymore. When you see 3 wands of magic missile in Gehennom,
don't pick any of them up.

Also, be sure your strength and constitution are maxxed out, as this will
increase your carry weight.

